WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.880
Mitchell, delivered for Pino!

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.480
Hit the crossbar.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.640
Comes across goal, it's still alive...

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.520
Oh, it's offside.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.320
Looking to send over a good 'un!

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.720
Couldn't quite keep it down.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.600
Mitchell's cross, and arriving is Kamada!

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.280
And it's an outstanding save from Alisson.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.720
There's Mac Allister!

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.880
And they are in front.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.960
Little man, biggest character,

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.520
Alexis Mac Allister heads Liverpool
into the lead.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.480
Ronald Araujo has done well there.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.320
Played a very good ball for Bradley Barcola,
two wait in the middle...

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.200
There you go!

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.560
Florian Wirtz.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:56.040
Marvellously made by Bradley Barcola.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.880
Munoz at pace, on to Alexander Isak.

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.560
Good save by Henderson.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:10.440
Great read, Trey Nyoni, who again has
been brilliant since he came on.

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.640
Munoz, turns on the afterburners.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:19.320
Munoz's ball, Florian Wirtz...

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.440
Isak!

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.920
Bang. Close the door on this one.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:28.760
Alexander Isak for Liverpool,
and they've done it in style.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.960
Liverpool have had to work hard,
but they've earned it.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:36.640
Osorio with an air kick.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:41.840
Oh, and then he clashes heads with
Milos Kerkez, that's a horrible collision.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.160
- He's given a penalty. Just unbelievable.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.080
- Oh, good penalty by Nketiah.

